        ],
        "summary": "Get Tender",
        "description": "One notice, enriched like a search result. Open to members and to workspace API keys; no quota is\nconsumed here since the detail is always a follow-up to a search that already paid for one. `favorite`\nreflects the workspace given (users) or the key's workspace (API keys).",
